00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.078
[Live Arena Crowd Roar]

00:00:02.078 --> 00:00:05.500
Hello Chicago!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.419
I'm Ryan O'Connell!

00:00:09.459 --> 00:00:14.200
And this is my sister, Cassidy!

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:25.783
And we are The Stardust Engine!

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:49.518
[Instrumental Intro — High-Gain Arena Rock Riff]

00:00:49.518 --> 00:00:54.454
