00:01:19.466 --> 00:01:23.000
We are the Stardust Engine!

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.008
Racing through the night

00:01:25.008 --> 00:01:30.500
We're burning on the fuel of a brand new light

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:34.200
We are the Stardust Engine!

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:37.500
